954-2275c018a22f" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678176}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "7a6b6cd2-5e3e-5af2-a25d-55ab52bf40c6" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 \\cot{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 - 4 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 \\cot{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\csc{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186678180 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2fd18b9b-016e-5e4b-a350-740cfd5f00c5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678145} {:answer/id #uuid "7f95a1bd-7610-5262-b814-39a994730ffb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678175} {:answer/id #uuid "bd3482f7-8203-50a5-b540-02f254e6ca84" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678208} {:answer/id #uuid "d51eb858